NAME: Weather

DESCRIPTION:

Weather forecast is obtained from https://api.weather.gov.

If the weather forecast has been downloaded within the past 4 hours
then the forecast is not downloaded again. Select 'R' to force a new
forecast download.

Display choices:
- Day:  daytime
- D+N:  day and night
- Hour: hourly

Selecting a Day or D+N forecast will display and speak the detailed forecast.

NOTES:

Downloading the forecast can take several seconds.
